<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Buttar Estate & Builder</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #333;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #000, #333);
      color: #f9d342;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    nav {
      background-color: #111;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 15px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #f9d342;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }

    section {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #000;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-left: 5px solid #f9d342;
      padding-left: 10px;
    }

    .services, .properties {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #f9f9f9;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 10px;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .contact form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .contact input, .contact textarea {
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .contact button {
      background-color: #f9d342;
      color: #000;
      padding: 12px;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .contact button:hover {
      background-color: #000;
      color: #f9d342;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: #f9d342;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header id="home">
    <h1>Buttar Estate & Builder</h1>
    <p>Welcome to Buttar Estate & Builder — Your Trusted Real Estate Partner in DHA Lahore</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#properties">Properties</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
      At <strong>Buttar Estate & Builder</strong>, we specialize in property buying, selling, renting, and construction services in Lahore, particularly in DHA Commercial Broadway. 
      With years of experience, our mission is to help you find the best property investments and dream homes with trust and transparency.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="services">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Buying" alt="Buying Property">
        <h3>Buying Property</h3>
        <p>Find your dream property with our expert buying assistance in prime DHA Lahore locations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Selling" alt="Selling Property">
        <h3>Selling Property</h3>
        <p>We help you sell your property fast at the best market price with trusted buyers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Renting" alt="Renting Property">
        <h3>Renting</h3>
        <p>Find quality tenants or rental properties easily through our verified listings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Construction" alt="Construction Services">
        <h3>Construction</h3>
        <p>We build modern, luxury homes and commercial projects that meet your standards and vision.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="properties">
    <h2>Featured Properties</h2>
    <div class="properties">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Luxury+House+DHA" alt="Luxury Home">
        <h3>DHA Lahore House</h3>
        <p>5 Marla Luxury House for Sale in DHA Lahore — Prime location and elegant design.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x250?text=Commercial+Plot" alt="Commercial Plot">
        <h3>Commercial Plot</h3>
        <p>2 Kanal Commercial Plot available in DHA Broadway — perfect for investment or construction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>We’d love to hear from you! Get in touch today for property consultation or visit our office.</p>
    <form>
      <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
      <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
      <textarea rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
    </form>
    <br>
    <iframe
      src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=DHA%20Commercial%20Broadway%2C%20Lahore%2C%20Pakistan&output=embed"
      allowfullscreen=""
      loading="lazy">
    </iframe>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>📍 D.H.A. Commercial Broadway, Lahore, 54000 | 📞 0321-4110129 | ✉️ info@redbookestate.com</p>
    <p>© 2025 Buttar Estate & Builder. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
